Package: qore-sysconf-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-sysconf-module-doc
Description: system configuration queries for Qore
 This module queries system-wide runtime parameters, string configuration
 values and file system limits through sysconf, confstr and pathconf.
 Compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools.

Package: qore-sysconf-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-sysconf-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's sysconf module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 system configuration module.
